---
import Slide from '../ui/Slide.astro';
import Callout from '../ui/Callout.astro';
---

<Slide
  id="s49-incident-oom"
  chapter="Production Incidents"
  title="Incident: OOMKilled — Memory Leak"
  notes="Symptom: service degrades over hours then pods restart in a loop. Observe: describe shows Last State Terminated Reason OOMKilled, Exit Code 137. Locate: memory working set metric climbs linearly — classic leak, not spike. Narrow: only one container in the deployment; limits at 512Mi, requests at 256Mi. Verify: kubectl logs --previous shows no error — JVM/process killed mid-GC. Fix: short-term raise limit to buy time; real fix is leak in connection cache (code). Validate: memory plateaus after fix deploy. Prevent: alert on memory approaching limit at 80%, track OOMKilled events, load test in CI."
>
  <div class="stagger flex flex-col gap-8">
    <Callout type="signal" title="Symptom">
      Slow responses over 6 hours → sudden pod restarts → CrashLoopBackOff. No deploy, no traffic spike.
    </Callout>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-6">
        <div class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-deck-cyan">Observe</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-deck-muted">Restarts ↑, latency ↑ over hours</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-6">
        <div class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-deck-amber">Locate</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-deck-muted"><strong class="text-deck-text">OOMKilled</strong>, exit 137 in describe</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-deck-border bg-deck-panel p-6">
        <div class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-deck-rose">Narrow</div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-deck-muted">Grafana: memory linear climb to limit</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <Callout type="rule">
      Exit 137 = SIGKILL. Confirm <code class="text-deck-cyan">Last State.Reason: OOMKilled</code> — logs may be empty because the process was killed.
    </Callout>
  </div>
</Slide>
